## Design References
Always refer to `@ref/` for layout, spacing, and structure. The home dashboard targets **`ref/Wise iOS 42.png`** as the canonical density and softness benchmark.
- **Wise (`ref/Wise iOS 42.png`, `ref/Wise iOS 180.png`):** Dashboards, account lists, transaction history, overall softness/density.
- **Coinbase (`ref/Coinbase iOS 34.png`):** Crypto lists, buy/sell, portfolio.
- **MoonPay (`ref/MoonPay iOS 28.png`, `ref/MoonPay iOS 81.png`):** Step forms, card inputs, status timelines.

Icon packs must be **filled** icons from https://hugeicons.com and nowhere else (stroke variants only for inactive nav states).

