## Design Tokens

All widgets read from `AzamanColors` via `ref.watch(themeProvider).colors`. Never hardcode hex.

### Color (Light theme — canonical)

| Token | Hex | Role |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `background` | `#FAFAFB` | Near-white page canvas |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Bottom nav / sheet surfaces |
| `card` | `#FFFFFF` | Inner chips on a soft card (e.g. icon circles) |
| `softSurface` | `#F1F1F3` | **Default card & pill fill** — the soft gray that defines the look |
| `divider` | `#E6E6E9` | Lightest hairline only; use sparingly |
| `accent` | `#B8860B` | Gold — primary filled actions & active states only |
| `success` | `#018C5C` | Positive money movement, credits |
| `danger` | `#D32C44` | Failures, destructive actions only |
| `textPrimary` | `#111827` | Headings, balances |
| `textSecondary` | `#374151` | Secondary labels |
| `textTertiary` | `#6B7280` | Helper text, metadata |

Dark and Midnight themes mirror these roles with their own `softSurface` (one step off `card`).

### Typography (Inter)
- Strong but light: prefer **`w700`–`w800`**, never `w900`. Large numbers should feel confident, not aggressive.
- **Greeting/Screen title:** ~27px, `w800`, tracking `-0.5`.
- **Section title (e.g. "Transactions"):** ~19px, `w800`, tracking `-0.4`.
- **Balance number:** ~33px, `w800`, tracking `-0.6`, tabular figures.
- **Body / labels:** 12.5–15px, `w400`–`w700`, tracking `~-0.2`.

### Border Radii
- **Cards (balance, wallet, feature):** `22px`
- **Pills / buttons:** `20px`
- **Inner chips / icon tiles:** `6–8px` or full circle

### Spacing (home rhythm)
Keep the stack tight: header → title `16` → actions `16` → balance card `18` → sections `28`. Card padding `18`. Avoid gaps `>32` between connected sections.

